  "metadata": {
    "title": "How can turning circles draw a musical note?",
    "lang": "en",
    "description": "Break an outline into a chain of turning circles: the more circles, the closer the curve gets to the shape. Every step is computed from real Fourier coefficients, so you can step through it again on your own.",
